  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managing ECHO stockpiles of Non-Food Items in Regional Warehouses for Emergency Responses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM is supporting the Directorate-General for European Civil Protection and Humanitarian Aid Operations (ECHO) in the establishment of their European Humanitarian Response Capacity (EHRC) Emergency Regional Stockpiles in reaction to the increased difficulty of delivering relief items to affected populations due to global supply chain and other sectoral challenges. Through this 18-month project, IOM supports ECHO with pre-positioned stocks in strategically located warehouses, ready to be rapidly delivered to people in need by ECHO certified partners.</narrative>
  </description>
